      "revision": 1344002861,
      "text": "Phyllostachys nuda is a species of bamboo in the family Poaceae. It is native to Anhui, Fujian, Hunan, Jiangsu, Jiangxi, Shaanxi, Zhejiang provinces of China and in Taiwan. It can survive temperatures down to −10 °F (−23 °C) and requires full sun to thrive."
